OL,3,GNEWSAMum who died in bus stop crash
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum who died after a car crashed into
OL,7,Fa bus stop has "left a remarkable stamp
OL,8,Fon this world", her family has said.
OL,10,FDanielle Sharpe, 34, died at the scene
OL,11,Fon Fotheringhay Road, Corby, at about
OL,12,F07:30 BST last Friday.
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire Police previously said
OL,15,Fa black Vauxhall Insignia had "appeared
OL,16,Fto be turning left into Fotheringhay
OL,17,FRoad when it left its intended path". A
OL,18,Fsecond pedestrian, a teenage boy,
OL,19,Fsuffered minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
